  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The rawest currents of the unseen world flow into the one who fastens it. It anchors a mind against the chaos of high magic, lending an authority that commands the very air to bend to a speaker's will."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Stiffened leather is bound by thick, braided cords of silver-thread silk. The buckle is dull bronze, worn smooth by years of travel and the constant friction of a traveler's robes."
    }
  },
